  "hazards": [
    "29:1 Abijah is Hezekiah mother, not male king; her father Zechariah identity needs evidence.29:12 Joel son Azariah and Azariah son Jehallelel are different people.",
    "29:13 Jeuel and29:14 Jehuel retain witness spelling and separate house associations unless identity proof; families Elizaphan/Asaph/Heman/Jeduthun are ancestral references, not necessarily physically present.",
    "29:25 David/Gad/Nathan and29:30 Asaph are prior authority/song references; distinguish named source references from physical assembly.",
    "30:1 Ephraim/Manasseh invitation concerns communities;30:6 Israel within Abraham/Isaac/Israel denotes ancestor, whereas children of Israel is collective.30:10 country and30:11 men have geographic/collective scopes.",
    "31:10 Azariah chief priest house Zadok not automatically earlier Azariah namesakes.31:12 Conaniah brother Shimei and31:13/15 numerous overseers each need family/role-specific proof.",
    "32:9 Sennacherib is at Lachish while servants go Jerusalem.32:10\u201315/17 are hostile Assyrian speech, not narrator facts endorsing theology or Hezekiah deception.",
    "32:21 angel narrative and32:24 illness/sign do not license invented identity, medical diagnosis, or extra details from parallel books without explicit attribution/gating.32:30 Gihon infrastructure is specified in text; modern exact coordinates require separate proof.",
    "32:33 Manasseh son successor differs from tribe/ancestor Manasseh elsewhere in these chapters."
  ],
